    "result_text": "I agree with the finding and addressed it. The memberId's REGION/FY boundary is now defined in exactly one place:\n\n- Added a private `regionEnd(String)` helper that returns the index just past the leading letters (where the FY segment begins).\n- `regionOf` now builds its result from `regionEnd(...)` (`end == 0 ? \"UNKNOWN\" : substring(0, end)`).\n- `fiscalYear(String)` now reads `start = regionEnd(memberId)` instead of its own duplicated loop.\n\nThis mirrors how `locality` already delegates to `regionOf`, so the memberId layout knowledge lives in one spot. Tests remain green (**Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0 \u2014 BUILD SUCCESS**).",
